---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section id="about" title="About" eyebrow="01">
  <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300">
    <p>
      I'm a Software Engineer in Test: I design and build the systems that test software, not
      just the tests themselves. That means the automation framework, the internal tools QA
      teams use every day, the infrastructure those tools run on, and — increasingly — the AI
      agents that write, run, and triage tests alongside a human team.
    </p>
    <p>
      Day to day that looks like building a data layer so tests can set up their own state
      instead of hoping it already exists, standing up agent-based test infrastructure that
      turns an overnight regression into a lunch-break one, and designing AI "skills" that turn
      multi-step QA chores into a single approval.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work I build small tools and games for myself and friends — soundboards, home
      automation, game mods, and the occasional text adventure — usually to scratch a specific
      itch rather than to ship a product.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
